    "  {\n",
    "   \"metadata\": {},\n",
    "   \"cell_type\": \"markdown\",\n",
    "   \"source\": [\n",
    "    \"### RATING FILM PRODOTTI DOPO IL 2000\\n\",\n",
    "    \"function in pytho with jupyter notebook that creates a bar plot that shows the rating of films created after the 2000 . Tha rating is a float value that goes from 1 to 5. every bar should rapresent an unit\"\n",
    "   ],\n",
    "   \"id\": \"d7b6218d74906fd\"\n",
    "  },\n",
    "  {\n",
    "   \"metadata\": {},\n",
    "   \"cell_type\": \"code\",\n",
    "   \"source\": \"fun.movie_rating_century(movies_df)\",\n",
    "   \"id\": \"b4c60de6444ffef9\",\n",
    "   \"outputs\": [],\n",
    "   \"execution_count\": null\n",
    "  },\n",
    "  {\n",
    "   \"metadata\": {},\n",
    "   \"cell_type\": \"code\",\n",
    "   \"source\": \"fun.movie_rating_century(movies_df, False)\",\n",
    "   \"id\": \"77efe5c3b61189f7\",\n",
    "   \"outputs\": [],\n",
    "   \"execution_count\": null\n",
    "  },\n",
    "  {\n",
    "   \"metadata\": {},\n",
    "   \"cell_type\": \"markdown\",\n",
    "   \"source\": \"Beh che dire, dopo il l'inizio del 21esimo secolo, nonostante la miglior tecnologia, abbiamo meno film con un rating maggiore di 4 punti compresi.\",\n",
    "   \"id\": \"e887fdee7718d60a\"\n",
    "  },\n",
    "  {\n",
    "   \"metadata\": {},\n",
    "   \"cell_type\": \"markdown\",\n",
    "   \"source\": \"## Poster Trends\",\n",
    "   \"id\": \"db03e0e14a3970ae\"\n",
    "  },\n",
    "  {\n",
    "   \"metadata\": {},\n",
    "   \"cell_type\": \"markdown\",\n",
    "   \"source\": \"## Release Trends\\n\",\n",
    "   \"id\": \"67b472e1ecaf5e2d\"\n",
    "  },\n",
